,"html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee571dca34fde189\" href=\"?note=ee571dca34fde189\" title=\"43-df-arith-random\">43-df-arith-random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个固定预言机的ML随机点集测度1。算术随机点集是关于有限跳跃的可数交，仍测度1。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.6证明，印刷192，PDF212。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-arith-random","status":"resolved","id":"ee571dca34fde189","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-arith-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-relrandom-measure","status":"resolved","id":"6d2e6e91fb32d6c4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-relrandom-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度；$\\mathrm{ArithRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-arith-random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-arith-random","status":"resolved","id":"ee571dca34fde189","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度；$\\mathrm{ArithRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-arith-random]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\})=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1137,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-arith-random-measure]] — 算术随机点具有全测度"}],"outgoing":["ee571dca34fde189","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","6d2e6e91fb32d6c4"]}